ApiKeyAuth.description:
**Server-to-server authentication** - API key for server-to-server communication.
Use as query parameter: ?apikey=your-api-key-here

Configure in app.js:
```javascript
'@apostrophecms/express': {
  options: {
    apiKeys: {
      'myapikey1029384756': { role: 'admin' }
    }
  }
}
```
